Package: agreeR
Title: Agreement Analysis for Method Comparison Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Stuart",
    family = "Guppy",
    comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9209-7409"),
    email = "sguppy-91@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Estimates agreement between two measurement methods using
  Bland-Altman limits of agreement, ordinary least products regression,
  and equivalence testing (TOST). Designed for single-measurement
  per-subject method comparison studies common in sport and exercise
  science. Not yet extensively validated; use with care and check
  assumptions.
